# UPANISHADS WISDOM APP - AI CODING GUIDELINES

## PROJECT CONTEXT
Name: Upanishads Wisdom App
Purpose: Anxiety-relief through ancient Upanishadic wisdom (ages 15-40)
Stack: Next.js 14 (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
Status: MVP complete, shipping today

## CODE STYLE

### React/Next.js
- Server components by default
- Client components only when needed ("use client")
- TypeScript strict mode
- Functional components only

### Tailwind CSS
- Custom colors: Sage green #A8B5A0, Warm cream #F5F1E8, Earth brown #8B7355
- Mobile-first responsive design

### File Naming
- Components: PascalCase (InsightCard.tsx)
- Pages: lowercase with hyphens (insight-1/page.tsx)
- Content: kebab-case (insight-1-intro.md)

## CONTENT GUIDELINES

### Tone & Voice
- Warm friend, not guru
- Modern language, ancient wisdom
- No jargon without explanation

### Sanskrit Terms
- Always include Devanagari: *Term* (देवनागरी)
- Provide English translation immediately

### Source Citations
- All quotes from Eknath Easwaran translations
- Format: "Katha Upanishad I.2.1-2 (Easwaran)"

## UX PRINCIPLES

- Logo clicks to Dashboard
- Back buttons go to Insights Library
- Entire cards clickable
- Time expectations visible (2 min, 3 min, 10 min)

## PHILOSOPHY

- Ship fast, learn fast, iterate
- Validate before scaling
- Quality > quantity

